# ArzlyAI Mobile

Flutter client for ArzlyAI. Clean Architecture. Dart ^3.11.5, Riverpod (`riverpod_generator`), Dio, Freezed, Json Serializable, Drift, [shadcn_ui](https://mariuti.com/flutter-shadcn-ui/).

No comments in source files. No `print()` — use `logger` or `debugPrint()`. Generated `*.g.dart` / `*.freezed.dart` are excluded from analysis.

## Architecture

| Layer | Path | Responsibility |
|---|---|---|
| Domain | `lib/domain/` | Entities, repository contracts. No implementation deps. |
| Data | `lib/data/` | Repositories, providers, remote/local sources. |
| Core | `lib/core/` | Network, enums, theme assembly, utilities. |
| UI | `lib/ui/` | Presentation. Riverpod for state. |
| Infrastructor | `lib/infrastructor/` | DB, migrations, seed data. |

| UI subpath | Responsibility |
|---|---|
| `lib/ui/features/` | Feature screens and feature-local private widgets. Never barrel-exported from `ui.dart`. |
| `lib/ui/shared/widgets/` | App-wide reusable shadcn-based components. |
| `lib/ui/validators/` | Shared validation helpers. |

| Data subpath | Responsibility |
|---|---|
| `lib/data/providers/temp/` | Short-lived UI field / form state notifiers. Reuse across screens when the same shape appears again. |

`lib/ui/ui.dart` exports only `shared/widgets` and `validators` — not features.

No user authentication. No login/register flows, no session tokens, no auth interceptors, no auth providers. Provider credentials use secure storage and encrypted envelopes per backend contract — not app-level user auth.

Work step by step (DTO → entity → mapper → UI) only when told. Smallest correct diff. Do not run codegen unless asked.

